{"reviewId": "254854030_88562ZVVV", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "商品价格里同时藏着两种周期：\n1. 很长很长的趋势 2. 相对短一点的超级周期\n商品价格不是只涨只跌，里面还包含一个非常缓慢几十年不变的长期大趋势（Trend），比如通胀、技术进步、资源枯竭带来的缓慢价格抬升，这个是长期底色。然后把这个缓慢趋势去掉后剩下的就是围绕长期趋势上下波动、周期更长但比康波短、幅度非常猛的波动，这个15-25年左右的大波动叫作超级周期（Super Cycle），它和固定资产投资、中周期密切相关，比单纯的产能周期更明显、更贴合价格走势。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "超级周期", "range": "19546-19550", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "254854030_88562ZVVV", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775183304, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 211979211, "name": "蜡妹小欣", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/78EkX665csCnhF3ic21HRJFL2EIdUPG3xnKSoDSOFq5dmrETnQFpIK5e841j3n64vF2I2JlwUEKs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "就跟名义GDP和实际GDP一样，实际GDP是剔除了通胀等外部因素是实